  - '* He''ll absorb it and end this\n  horrid world...'
  - '* ... Ms. Dreemurr???\n^05* Is that you?!'
  - '* Are you okay???\n^05* Can you even hear\n  me???'
  - '* Okay,^05 did we end\n  up in the crazy\n  dimension or something?'
